{"id":"n31952-2-2","stage":1,"title":"저것 · 那家伙","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31952-2-2-1","ko":"저것들 너무 보기 싫어.","zh":"真不想看到那帮人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저것들","meaning":"那家伙","explanation":"저것：那家伙；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"저것","audio":"/audio/47694f4ba39848866c8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31952","senseId":"2","lemma":"저것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보기","meaning":"更，还","explanation":"보다：更，还；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26847","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싫어.","meaning":"讨厌","explanation":"싫다：讨厌；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"47694f4ba3984886","term":"저것","zh":"那家伙","audio":"/audio/47694f4ba39848866c8f.mp3","entryId":"31952","definition":"(贬称)那个人。","pronunciation":["저걷"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"更，还","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"26847","definition":"跟某个相比，愈加。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"讨厌","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不中意。","pronunciation":["실타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5bd6c8af3f169dbdbeed.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31952-2-2-2","ko":"나도 그래서 되도록 멀리 떨어져 앉았어.","zh":"我也是，所以尽量坐得离他们远点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되도록","meaning":"必须","explanation":"되다：必须；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멀리","meaning":"远远地，遥远地，久远地","explanation":"멀리：远远地，遥远地，久远地","readings":[{"term":"멀리","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54965","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어져","meaning":"分开，分离","explanation":"떨어지다：分开，分离；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"13","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉았어.","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"必须","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某件事一定要实现。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"f62a38710e04901c","term":"멀리",